Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:07.34,Default,,0,0,900,,Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:13.04,Default,,0,0,900,,Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:18.74,Default,,0,0,900,,He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:25.14,Default,,0,0,900,,does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:30.96,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:36.70,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:42.50,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:47.90,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:01:00.26,Default,,0,0,900,,I am calling, calling now. Spirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:05.70,Default,,0,0,900,,To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:12.02,Default,,0,0,900,,Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.04,0:01:17.52,Default,,0,0,900,,in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:23.50,Default,,0,0,900,,To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:28.90,Default,,0,0,900,,The flow may swallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.24,0:02:00.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, wake up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.94,0:02:06.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Everyone always gets synchronised after \Nmissions, so why am I the only one who wasn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:13.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou-san's all-natural oil!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:37.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oooh! There's a lot of information!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.50,0:02:43.35,Default,,550,0,350,,Tachikoma \N Runs \N Away \N \N A Movie\NDirector's\NDream
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.47,0:03:03.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Cool! My experience points are rapidly rising!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.95,0:03:16.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Locky!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.58,0:03:24.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, you, have you seen Locky?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.48,0:03:26.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Locky?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.33,0:03:37.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Locky is the name of the dog I used to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.43,0:03:39.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.94,0:03:43.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Keep a pet? Lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.81,0:03:45.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.44,0:03:48.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Will you help me look for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:51.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I want to head towards town now, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.74,0:03:56.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm also thinking about going\Nthrough town to Ocean View Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.74,0:03:56.44,Comment,,0,1100,900,,Note: "Ocean View Park" is probably based \N on "Harbour View Park" in Yokohama
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.99,0:03:59.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I think Locky's probably over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.18,0:04:05.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sure, I can go with you if we stay in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.31,0:04:07.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Really? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.33,0:04:10.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.03,0:04:12.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm Miki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.33,0:04:13.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm Tachikoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.83,0:04:14.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tachikoma?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.57,0:04:19.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nice to meet you, Tachikoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:55.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.81,0:04:59.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I think Locky's probably hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.01,0:05:01.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's why I'm buying this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:10.52,Comment,,650,0,350,,{\i1\b1}Note: Red dog is the name\N for edible dogs.{\i\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:10.50,RED,,475,0,400,,{\b1\i1}RED \N DOG{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:13.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I think it would be better if you didn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.79,0:05:14.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.39,0:05:17.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That is... Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.13,0:05:21.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That can't... Doesn't that dog look like Locky?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.64,0:05:32.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What do you think? Is this Locky?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.59,0:05:36.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's not him, Locky isn't that skinny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.49,0:05:37.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.97,0:05:43.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, Tachikoma! That's mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.27,0:05:46.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Mean? But that's not the dog we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.07,0:05:48.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That wasn't Locky, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.47,0:05:51.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even though it wasn't Locky,\Nyou shouldn't be so cruel, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.17,0:05:54.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That wasn't cruel, we just don't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:57.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Enough, if you do that again I'll be really angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.25,0:06:21.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Eh? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:25.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I sense the vague presence of something enormous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.87,0:06:34.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's this? Isn't this a cyberbrain?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.07,0:06:37.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Eh? But this doesn't have a defensive barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.97,0:06:43.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Could this be that "revolving lantern" phenomenon\Nhumans supposedly see in their final moments?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.97,0:06:43.97,Comment,,0,0,900,,Note: "Revolving lantern" (走馬灯) is the Japanese idiom \Nfor one's life flashing before their eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.99,0:06:48.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh? You are me? Me and you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.39,0:06:51.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,E-eh? It's a ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:52.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you doing, Tachikoma?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.12,0:06:57.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ah... Nothing, nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:07:01.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tachikoma, you just stole something, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.55,0:07:04.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Taking people's things without asking is stealing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.05,0:07:07.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's selfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.15,0:07:11.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now, hand over what you're hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.35,0:07:12.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You, the little girl over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.65,0:07:13.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.06,0:07:16.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you doing in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:20.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you have any identification with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.65,0:07:23.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is this your pet robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.35,0:07:27.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Little girl, where do you live?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.91,0:07:30.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.71,0:07:34.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Despite my appearance,\NI am this child's guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.61,0:07:40.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,During the war, I was on the front\Nline and sustained near-fatal injuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.41,0:07:42.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so they put my brain in this\Ntank as an emergency treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.81,0:07:44.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I still look like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.81,0:07:52.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's rude to call someone who loved his country\Nso much that he lost his body for it, a pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.71,0:07:56.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You kids today have had a comfortable life with\Nno war; you wouldn't know anything about...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.61,0:07:56.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I get it! It's okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.79,0:08:03.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Cool! Was that ventriloquism?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.19,0:08:04.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.39,0:08:08.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's go search that Ocean View\NPark you mentioned earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.39,0:08:10.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Eh? You'll go with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.89,0:08:14.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, there aren't any fun things left here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:16.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and Locky is definitely waiting for you\Nthere, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.99,0:08:19.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah! Thank you, Tachikoma!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.22,0:08:32.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Locky has been with me ever since I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:38.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We play together, we eat\Ntogether, we even sleep together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.97,0:08:42.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, you two are close friends then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.57,0:08:43.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.37,0:08:46.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, how did Locky get lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.77,0:08:49.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's always with you, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.71,0:08:50.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.81,0:08:58.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, Tachikoma, do you know the\Nstory of "The Secret Goldfish"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.71,0:09:01.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"The Secret Goldfish"? Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.71,0:09:05.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The main character in the story is a girl like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.81,0:09:07.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Story?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.01,0:09:08.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.71,0:09:14.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's a story about a girl who\Nwouldn't show her goldfish to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.55,0:09:22.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She wouldn't show anyone her goldfish\Nthat she bought with her own allowance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.95,0:09:28.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, the adults around her were\Nworried about how upset she was,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.95,0:09:32.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but the truth was that the\Ngoldfish had already died,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.25,0:09:35.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and the adults around her hadn't realised that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.45,0:09:38.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,because she wouldn't show the goldfish to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.75,0:09:41.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Umm, I don't understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.75,0:09:43.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wasn't the goldfish already dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.45,0:09:47.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Couldn't she use her allowance to buy a new one?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.25,0:09:49.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That wouldn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:53.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The dead goldfish can't come back...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.56,0:10:01.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The little girl didn't want the grown-ups to think\Nshe was sad that her goldfish died.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.56,0:10:05.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Because she was already very sad herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.32,0:10:42.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Isn't this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.07,0:10:49.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I really knew that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.67,0:10:54.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When I came back from daycare on\NThursday, Locky was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.87,0:10:57.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He was sick before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:11:00.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Mama insisted that Locky\Nwas just wandering outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.57,0:11:08.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, on both Friday and Saturday, when I said I was\Ngoing to find Locky, Papa and Mama both said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.46,0:11:13.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, even though I already\Nknew that Locky was dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.96,0:11:20.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I still had to pretend to look for him, because\NMama and Papa don't know that I know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:28.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's very sad for humans when\Ntheir best friend dies, isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.08,0:11:31.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't understand the concept of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.08,0:11:34.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I just think of it as a body without a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.58,0:11:36.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I also don't understand the concept of sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.78,0:11:40.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't think I'm capable of dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.08,0:11:43.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You can't die?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.38,0:11:46.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, because I'm an AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.38,0:11:48.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, you won't die if I keep you as a pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.68,0:11:49.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.63,0:11:51.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even if you're run over by a car?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.13,0:11:51.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.84,0:11:53.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:58.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But I don't think I want to have another pet now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.28,0:12:05.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't you think it's about\Ntime for you to go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.28,0:12:09.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Your Papa and Mama would be\Nsad too if you were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.18,0:12:10.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.87,0:12:43.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wish you wouldn't make such a serious face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.17,0:12:44.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's not like I ran away...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.07,0:12:46.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.69,0:12:49.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The all-natural oil you inserted...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.09,0:12:56.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,left traces that a very small amount of the protein used in\Nthe neurochip for the Tachikomas' AI has dissolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.53,0:13:03.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou only gave oil to this Tachikoma,\Nso it's the only one that's affected.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.53,0:13:06.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The information exuded from\Nthe oil is slowly accumulating,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.03,0:13:11.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and it's possible that with that as a starting point,\Nthe Tachikoma's AI reconstructed its operating memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.52,0:13:16.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou treats that Tachikoma too much like a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.12,0:13:18.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's only a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.22,0:13:21.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's discrimination!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.72,0:13:22.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I demand that you take back what you said!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.52,0:13:24.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're cold-hearted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:26.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You should love machines too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.89,0:13:32.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This will be a major discovery\Nfor the AI research community.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.49,0:13:35.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh well, if the Major finds\Nout, she'll give you an earful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.19,0:13:36.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.49,0:13:38.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.66,0:13:40.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ah! That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.16,0:13:47.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good morning, Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.96,0:13:50.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sucking up to me won't work either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.86,0:13:53.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,From now on, they're not allowed\Nto use any all-natural oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.26,0:13:55.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay, Batou!?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.86,0:13:58.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa, go back and investigate that box.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:00.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ishikawa, you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.06,0:14:05.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Seems like word got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.96,0:14:07.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bad news always travels fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:09.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder how she found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.66,0:14:10.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:15.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:17.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't tell me you've been online all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:21.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are the contents of this box dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.18,0:14:25.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We just brought him back from\Ndiving a little while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.08,0:14:29.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,His voice was suddenly cut off\Nin the middle of the trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.96,0:14:33.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just what in the world is this, Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:38.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When the Tachikoma picked up\Nthis box it accessed the content,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.46,0:14:40.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and the box immediately synchronised\Nwith the Tachikoma's AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:43.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There is evidence that data\Nwas poured into it in a split second.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.86,0:14:48.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I think it's some sort of\Nbrainwashing program, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.76,0:14:52.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I thought it might be some\Nsort of defensive barrier maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.96,0:14:55.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The backup system over here is perfect;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.96,0:15:01.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,there is no trace of program reverse-flow\Nor attacks on the investigator's brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.91,0:15:04.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You mean it wants to be brought back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.51,0:15:06.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That would be my guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.51,0:15:09.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is there any possibility that it's a virus?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.21,0:15:11.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let me see the record of the trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.05,0:15:24.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He seems to be trapped in\Nsome building-like place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.65,0:15:28.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Communication ceased when he was\Nin the long hallway, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.55,0:15:31.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The trace mentions stairs at\Nthe far end of the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.45,0:15:33.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll dive in and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.65,0:15:38.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, it's better to stay put until\Nyou get the boss's permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.35,0:15:40.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What if something happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.35,0:15:42.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's only IF something happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:45.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's strange that our\Ninvestigator hasn't returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.90,0:15:58.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Terminate the visual.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:16:01.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's pretty laggy, considering the boring view.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.29,0:16:07.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The interesting thing about this hallway is\Nthat it's made so you can only go forwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.28,0:16:10.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is there nothing but the hallway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.48,0:16:12.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So far.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.48,0:16:18.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If the princess would just close her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.69,0:16:21.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Here are the steps. I'm going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.38,0:16:24.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Watch out for traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.08,0:16:27.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Your safety is our first priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.38,0:16:29.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I can see a dim light.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.18,0:16:31.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I can faintly hear a human voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.98,0:16:32.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.60,0:16:35.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What-t-t-t-t-t...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.30,0:16:35.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait, Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.00,0:16:38.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, Major! Answer me, Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.80,0:16:40.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's no good, her ghost is already gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.10,0:16:42.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ghost hack?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.70,0:16:45.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, that's not it, we're not being attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:47.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nothing's moving on the defensive barrier either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.00,0:16:52.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major. Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.17,0:17:03.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.27,0:17:05.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That scene was a revelation to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:10.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I interpreted that scene as the moment when, having\Nglimpsed the truth, he resolved to live forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.97,0:17:11.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.57,0:17:15.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.37,0:17:16.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's no use
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.17,0:17:21.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Everyone here has been possessed by that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.17,0:17:24.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Possessed? By what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.07,0:17:25.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What "thing"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:32.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why don't you go in and check it out with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:38.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ah, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:43.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you don't hurry it'll\Nstart; there are no previews.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.67,0:17:55.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Movie theatre?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.23,0:18:00.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.63,0:18:02.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.23,0:18:03.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ah, Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.83,0:18:05.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Fancy meeting you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.13,0:18:07.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This person is magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.23,0:18:09.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, let's get out of here. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.75,0:18:47.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.25,0:18:50.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I certainly wouldn't say it was a bad movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.35,0:18:54.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, no matter what kind of entertainment it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.85,0:18:56.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,it should be temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:18:58.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,With no beginning or ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.85,0:19:02.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the audience is bewitched into not\Nletting go of a movie like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.75,0:19:06.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't think there's anything wonderful\Nabout that, in fact it's rather harmful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.55,0:19:09.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.75,0:19:14.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're trying to say that we\Nshould return to reality, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.85,0:19:15.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.65,0:19:23.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There are people in this audience who have\Nunhappy things waiting for them if they return.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.75,0:19:29.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you take away the audience's dreams,\Nwill you also take on their responsibilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.75,0:19:30.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.45,0:19:34.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Dreams only have meaning because\Nwe struggle in the waking world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.93,0:19:40.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just projecting yourself into other's\Ndreams is the same as being dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.13,0:19:42.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A realist, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.49,0:19:46.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you call someone who runs\Naway from reality a romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.49,0:19:49.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Such a strong girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.89,0:19:53.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Call me when you've made your belief reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.59,0:19:57.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We'll come out of this\Ntheatre when that time comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.86,0:20:07.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Geez, that gave me a cold chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.46,0:20:08.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:13.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was having a hard time breaking through the ghost's\Nbarrier, it wasn't a good time to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.26,0:20:16.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,At any rate, I've verified the records.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.86,0:20:18.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Kannazuki Wataru.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.66,0:20:21.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Your common, almost completely\Nunknown movie director.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.36,0:20:24.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In addition to his weird creator's stubbornness,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.16,0:20:29.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,he was unable to gather funds or talented staff,\Nand didn't complete a single decent project.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.86,0:20:33.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,At least he made his ideal\Nmovie in his own cyberbrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.86,0:20:41.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He removed part of his brain and spinal cord from his\Nbody and sealed it in that box with life-support devices.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.26,0:20:47.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In other words, this box is a miniature\Ntheatre filled with that director's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.06,0:20:50.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I guess it's become like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.46,0:20:52.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, what kind of movie was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.39,0:20:58.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I heard it had a cult following among some people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.09,0:21:01.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, they're not interested in just the movie,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.39,0:21:05.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,ghosts don't come back when they dive\Ninto the box, even if their body dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.89,0:21:08.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The police will try to get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.99,0:21:12.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There are rumours that the\Noriginal is still in the market,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.49,0:21:15.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and people don't know if that's true or\Nnot, but this is the true original.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.19,0:21:17.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The ghost definitely exists...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.29,0:21:21.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Where did the Tachikoma pick up such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.09,0:21:23.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There weren't any traps or hacking,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.39,0:21:29.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Keeping his visitors from leaving using nothing but\Nthe appeal of his work... I'm amazed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.49,0:21:30.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,it's quite an accomplishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.88,0:21:39.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, what should we do?\NMister director is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.88,0:21:46.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Remove the brain from the box and put it in\Na modified steel case so he can't go online.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.48,0:21:50.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Dig out the list of audience\Nmembers and retrieve their ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.28,0:21:55.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then, arrest the sidewalk vendor and\Ncharge him with selling body parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.78,0:21:58.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll go report to the chief, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.20,0:22:10.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well that's unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:15.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou, have you ever been so\Nmoved by a film that you cried?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.18,0:22:18.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why are you suddenly asking that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.88,0:22:20.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm heading back to the hangar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.98,0:22:23.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Gotta change my Tachikoma's oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.13,0:22:27.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Come to think of it, I did once a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.63,0:22:32.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I laughed so hard at a Marx\NBrothers flick that tears came out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.03,0:22:34.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How very like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.23,0:22:38.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Say, how about we go see\Na movie together sometime?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.33,0:22:45.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thanks, but all the movies I\Nreally want to see, I see alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.53,0:22:47.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What about movies you don't want to see so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.23,0:22:49.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.33,0:22:51.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.25,0:23:18.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.15,0:23:22.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.13,0:23:27.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.46,0:23:30.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.44,0:23:34.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.90,0:23:39.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.33,0:23:42.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.20,0:23:47.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But wake a lithium flower, just about to bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.35,0:23:50.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.04,0:23:54.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.44,0:23:59.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.64,0:24:00.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.34,0:24:02.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.74,0:24:04.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.31,0:24:07.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.31,0:24:10.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.82,0:24:14.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.70,0:24:32.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.40,0:24:35.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you want me to be alone so badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.00,0:24:37.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.20,0:24:39.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Get a hold of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.40,0:24:41.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tachikoma get over here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.60,0:24:42.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He'll pull out of it
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.26,0:24:49.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Surrounded by money from exploiting the\Npoor, he must be very pleased with himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.56,0:24:53.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Perhaps he thinks the exchange\Nrate is better on the yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.56,0:24:57.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is there no one here but dolls without ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.07,0:25:00.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Die by the very money you love so much!
